{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_13", "source_id": "681dffe3000000002101a510", "title": "从油痘肌到妈生好皮，不长痘痘闭口的经验", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681dffe3000000002101a510", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1173, "evidence_unit_count": 35, "original_evidence_unit_count": 35, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 120, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["想在零作為一個十一年的有豆機 今天我想分享一下 我是怎麼保持臉上不長痘痘一口的", "它為了效果好 它洗不乾淨 它會在頭髮上有殘留 加上我喜歡側睡", "就打了三瓶精華的工 性價比非常高 給你們看一下它的質地 是這種比較水感的", "出發性的暴痘悶屁股什麼的 皮膚變得很穩定 很多姐妹為什麼臉上一直", "都可以按照這個思路來服務 我覺得不需要很長的時間 出油啊 痘痘一口都會減少很多", "所以這邊就老是長 我把髮膜換掉之後自然就好了 再一個如果是下巴壓扣", "真的很少吸收 所以我現在再來半點管 我從11年前開始長痘"], "retained_quotes": ["所以這邊就老是長 我把髮膜換掉之後自然就好了 再一個如果是下巴壓扣", "真的很少吸收 所以我現在再來半點管 我從11年前開始長痘"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681dffe3000000002101a510/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681dffe3000000002101a510/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681dffe3000000002101a510/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681dffe3000000002101a510/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "7ad6a2ff1cb33d9a2434285fa78895af85a3aa5b13cada7d8aa81615c0671f2e", "card_hash": "b604d5462016e24f44aeb318526e81450df5cc60d1347ca32be15d3745c75dcf", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_13", "source_id": "681b78f6000000002101a5dd", "title": "4年没去美容院，皮肤反而更好了", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681b78f6000000002101a5dd", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1855, "evidence_unit_count": 55, "original_evidence_unit_count": 55, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 161, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 我是小森林 今天跟你們分享一期 去逗應縮毛孔細膩皮膚的護膚燈鏈", "護膚需求都一網打盡了 比每個月定期去外面做項目 要更省錢也更省時間", "然後它會有一個響聲 你就可以去打另一邊 所以它非常好操作", "後續搭配我們的能量棒和綠洲面霜 就可以了 如果是想要淡動硬的話", "一定要試試這個家庭板光子水光", "但是我想給你們展示我的後續護膚 所以把這把洗掉吧 如果你們不洗的話", "但是你第二次用就會好很多 越高的檔位痛感會越強一些 但是跟我們出去做那個痛感相比"], "retained_quotes": ["但是我想給你們展示我的後續護膚 所以把這把洗掉吧 如果你們不洗的話", "但是你第二次用就會好很多 越高的檔位痛感會越強一些 但是跟我們出去做那個痛感相比"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681b78f6000000002101a5dd/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681b78f6000000002101a5dd/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681b78f6000000002101a5dd/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681b78f6000000002101a5dd/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "4a3f6313f4f02742778c7dab796aac7400d52de98ef21330cc9b89f1fef22a26", "card_hash": "bb8a2eb01668585d98c770b61443b1827a792d439d0afc1c3cdb78fe93cfab02", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
