{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_13", "source_id": "681309e0000000002001e02d", "title": "油痘肌平价早晚间护肤，皮肤好到发光～", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681309e0000000002001e02d", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1942, "evidence_unit_count": 61, "original_evidence_unit_count": 61, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 231, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["來看一下早上的皮膚狀態 在發光 沒什麼油光 Hello 我是小森林", "但是它整個產品 做得非常非常溫和 所以新手小白 大家都可以放心用它", "這個一面刷我沒有記錯的話 它應該就兩百出頭 到我大錯的時候", "我這段時間用下來 覺得她的控油 性皮膚開氧化效果很不錯 我以前到了春夏", "但是把我們想照顧到的油 都給照顧到了 好了 寶貝們 我要去上班了 要去備戰618了 拜拜", "所以選抗氧化產品 一定要選這種不刺激的 那我就先去睡覺了", "前段時間我熬夜直播 還有趕香木 但是好在晚上一直有弄它 所以隔天起來之後"], "retained_quotes": ["所以選抗氧化產品 一定要選這種不刺激的 那我就先去睡覺了", "前段時間我熬夜直播 還有趕香木 但是好在晚上一直有弄它 所以隔天起來之後"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681309e0000000002001e02d/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681309e0000000002001e02d/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681309e0000000002001e02d/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681309e0000000002001e02d/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "0bdc080ea0bc49a8a96b577e77d52661729e0b7983e451ef15dfdbbc636acc6f", "card_hash": "5a597afb88235a76d6a1abcb33a24ef0b8c2c823135771c5d5f0ad377806fd4e", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_13", "source_id": "681074cc0000000021002ead", "title": "油痘肌护肤：从大牌追逐者变实用护肤主义", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681074cc0000000021002ead", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 919, "evidence_unit_count": 23, "original_evidence_unit_count": 23, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["以前我皮肤差的时候，最喜欢的事情就是去美容院做项目买各种小众大牌护肤品，我认为只要肯花钱，皮肤一定好", "下面几点是我总结下来觉得油皮变妈生好皮特别需要注意的，希望对大家有帮助[抱拳R]", "我打开皮肤通道的方式就是一周做一次家庭版毛孔深层清洁，我是超级容易长闭口的肤质，以前每周都要去针清闭口，但自从开始规律的做这个，我皮肤真的变得超光滑", "而且我喜欢拿酸 a和一些产品去叠，喜欢用贵妇产品的油皮姐妹你们拿酸 a 和你的贵妇产品去叠去，比单用效果更好", "#拯救大油皮[话题]# 以前的皮肤真是没眼看 黑红+闭口+痘痘+痘印", "因为护肤品每天都涂，但我们和别的肤质不同，别人用错顶多干燥起皮，再不然敏几天，过段时间就好", "然而并没有，因为我频繁的搞项目，各种乱用护肤品，反而把自己搞成了油痘敏肌，一张脸上又是高原红又是闭口又是痘印……"], "retained_quotes": ["因为护肤品每天都涂，但我们和别的肤质不同，别人用错顶多干燥起皮，再不然敏几天，过段时间就好", "然而并没有，因为我频繁的搞项目，各种乱用护肤品，反而把自己搞成了油痘敏肌，一张脸上又是高原红又是闭口又是痘印……"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681074cc0000000021002ead/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681074cc0000000021002ead/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681074cc0000000021002ead/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_681074cc0000000021002ead/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "36de101a563ddbd5d7c5294696fb905fbcd4e256e79f2a0cfaede4f9822fa929", "card_hash": "763261a