{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_13", "source_id": "680b7292000000001e0097b4", "title": "如何养成不易长闭口肤质", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_680b7292000000001e0097b4", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1120, "evidence_unit_count": 34, "original_evidence_unit_count": 34, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 128, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello,我是小三菱 给极性子的油皮姐妹分享一下 我是怎么从满脸的屁口", "家庭班还不就跟练 具体你们可以看 我主页制定的那张笔记 很多以前爱长豆", "不仅可以帮我们把皮肤 通道打开 促进后续糊米的吸收 而且还能把老费", "但是它 可以 接着我先去把我的头发吹干 我这样被你露视频头的感受", "每天坚持温和护肤 你们也可以从满脸闭口 变成不易长一口肤肢的 那我去睡觉了 晚安", "所以经常长闭口的油皮积累 一定要把脚质养护 换至到我的日常的护肤当中", "但是它 可以 接着我先去把我的头发吹干 我这样被你露视频头的感受"], "retained_quotes": ["所以经常长闭口的油皮积累 一定要把脚质养护 换至到我的日常的护肤当中", "但是它 可以 接着我先去把我的头发吹干 我这样被你露视频头的感受"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_680b7292000000001e0097b4/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_680b7292000000001e0097b4/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_680b7292000000001e0097b4/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_680b7292000000001e0097b4/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "aaf51f5bcc67767f1fbab3be9a7dc166861f69660d68af2574ab7153a4c8e24c", "card_hash": "16c89d1601021d09d64d79b8bb1eb0c3a55169b81cfb04f83727817ababef806", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_13", "source_id": "6808b257000000001d017ae9", "title": "油皮精简护肤我爱了！", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6808b257000000001d017ae9", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "step_sequence", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1147, "evidence_unit_count": 35, "original_evidence_unit_count": 35, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 112, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello 今天是一期油皮撐下的精簡燙老糊糊 我發現很多跟我一樣30家的油豆米雞", "因為它洗油呼吸 只不用擔心會過度清潔 又造成二次傷害 好", "容易出現粗糙 暗沉鬆垮的問題 嚴重的話 還會長一些不可逆的小紋路", "按照深圳現在的天氣 我用完它兩蹦之後 再薄薄的塗一個清爽的面霜", "這就是我春夏的經驗 看老護膚流程 希望對大家有幫助", "我們皮膚的出油量也變多了 我會直接用一個 膚感清爽 但是身兼數值的看我再玩", "89.010都和出油有關 所以一定要做好日常清潔 我最喜歡的是APG表護的"], "retained_quotes": ["我們皮膚的出油量也變多了 我會直接用一個 膚感清爽 但是身兼數值的看我再玩", "89.010都和出油有關 所以一定要做好日常清潔 我最喜歡的是APG表護的"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6808b257000000001d017ae9/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6808b257000000001d017ae9/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6808b257000000001d017ae9/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6808b257000000001d017ae9/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "aca6d28fbd39abc3008668e618f875849f3455ed9f6778d0d1430b4e01609e4a", "card_hash": "fe9f3587f9e1cd9eab02128b9624af081b4190555934d197237d84689010d5b3", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_13", "source_id": "6808bc37000000001d03914b", "title": "用了5年A醇的脸", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6808bc37000000001d03914b", "topic_family": "抗老与紧致", "mechanism_key": "identity_proof", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1157, "evidence_unit_count": 27, "original_evidence_unit_count": 27, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["今年是我用A醇的第5年，我很负责任地告诉你们，A醇是真的能把瑕疵皮爆改成水煮蛋的", "我喜欢用那种温和效果又很好的A醇， HBN双A醇晚霜就是这一挂的", "温和到像为敏肌量身定做的，据说它家去年还砸了很多钱专门找了上百人去做了SGS敏肌检测，全员都安稳下车，把温和跟高效的尺度拿捏得刚刚好，所以不管是新手还是敏肌都能放心用", "HONEYMATE 使用方活 BEAUTY NATURALISM", "抹开后立刻化成水 吸收后肤感好清爽 油皮用也没有压力", "很多人不敢用A醇担心会翻车，但是其实只要掌握了正确用法，它给你带来的收益甚至超过很多贵价护肤品，是我用过除了do项目以外，最快出效果的成分", "我现在手上用的是晚霜2.0，里面加了黄金配比——双重A醇+双重A酯，是拿复配A醇和单A醇做了很多实验对比才调配出来的黄金组合"], "retained_quotes": ["很多人不敢用A醇担心会翻车，但是其实只要掌握了正确用法，它给你带来的收益甚至超过很多贵价护肤品，是我用过除了do项目以外，最快出效果的成分", "我现在手上用的是晚霜2.0，里面加了黄金配比——双重A醇+双重A酯，是拿复配A醇和单A醇做了很多实验对比才调配出来的黄金组合"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6808bc37000000001d03914b/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6808bc37000000001d03914b/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6808bc37000000001d03914b/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_6808bc37000000001d03914b/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "8fa1cba1317d46a1af9eec19a90bca5a5ffcb0e2aabfa04362107b88fb362368", "card_hash"